      "content": "The decision is pretty much set at the exec level. The whole point of the Orion-native shift is to move away from this legacy architecture entirely to reduce technical debt. A \"smoother transition\" isn't really the priority right now—total modernization is. We're looking to decommission the current instance once the migration wave is complete. What specifically makes you think a fresh agent wouldn't be able to pick up where we are?",
